WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en
NOTE Compound Design case-study film · on-screen text only · no voice, no music

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.950
I built 17 tools with AI this year.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.150
They did not become a portfolio.

3
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.350
They became a system.

4
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.950
Different products.

5
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.950
Same mistakes.

6
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.550
Different products.

7
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.550
Same decisions.

8
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:15.550
Different products.

9
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:16.450
Same knowledge.

10
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.250
The output was compounding.

11
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.550
The knowledge wasn't.

12
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.950
I stopped keeping good decisions in my head.

13
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.500
I started encoding them.

14
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.700
What if the atomic unit was not only UI?

15
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.500
What if knowledge itself was composable?

16
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:44.300
Products generate knowledge.

17
00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.800
Knowledge becomes capability.

18
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.300
Capability improves the next product.

19
00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.800
The system does not only build interfaces.

20
00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:01.700
It inspects what it built.

21
00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.950
It does not only fix failures.

22
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.500
It decides which failures deserve to become knowledge.

23
00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:40.900
I thought I was building products with AI.

24
00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.650
I was actually building a way to build.

25
00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:45.950
Build the application.

26
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.200
Improve the system that builds the next one.

